    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Here are some cute hand-drawn cats that need your help. You can help by finding hidden things around you. Guess the cats' clues to lift the tablecloth, search through the mouse hole, and open the door.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can complete the Cat's Help mission by clicking on the hidden item. Complete the cat's 'help missions' to unlock the next stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you open the tomb incorrectly, you may be in for a surprise!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/921199dfee93e0faad7ae16a86157112.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Here are some cute hand-drawn cats that need your help. You can help by finding hidden things around you. Guess the cats' clues to lift the tablecloth, search through the mouse hole, and open the door.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/6de7cb22746432012dbe1261ae590678.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can complete the Cat's Help mission by clicking on the hidden item. Complete the cat's 'help missions' to unlock the next stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.poster.avif?t=1726252683\" width=618 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.webm?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865640/extras/2cb05b48be274a9469d100d81c40c90b.mp4?t=1726252683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you open the tomb incorrectly, you may be in for a surprise!",
